# datasets — share via Drive, too big for git
datasets/**/*.csv
datasets/**/*.jpg

# preprocessed_datasets is tracked on purpose. The manifests define the splits every
# notebook reads, so a fresh checkout has to land on the same rows without re-running
# the EDA notebook first. 16 MB of text, and no images are written here.

